WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:03.003
It was your father's last wish
that you dig his grave.

00:00:03.378 --> 00:00:04.004
What?

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:04.963
♪♪

00:00:07.049 --> 00:00:07.716
(Knock-knock)

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:08.467
(Door opens)

00:00:08.884 --> 00:00:10.093
Our father is dead. 

00:00:10.469 --> 00:00:13.305
His last wish was that his sons
attend his funeral.

00:00:13.305 --> 00:00:14.139
Ray:
You don't have to go.

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:15.682
He's dead.

00:00:16.934 --> 00:00:17.809
He'll never know.

00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:20.270
You are a very tender man.
You know that?

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:21.939
♪♪

00:00:21.939 --> 00:00:23.440
Mendes:
Okay. Your father's last will.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:26.026
It was his wish that you dig his
grave.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.736
♪♪

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:28.528
What?

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:30.739
♪♪

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:32.783
Raymond:
The old man was always screwing
with us.

00:00:33.951 --> 00:00:35.244
But, forgiveness is good.

00:00:35.244 --> 00:00:36.995
♪♪

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:40.040
I want to show you the casket
that your father pre-selected.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.667
♪♪

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:43.835
The cheapest man who ever lived.

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:45.963
♪♪

00:00:45.963 --> 00:00:46.797
Hi.

00:00:47.339 --> 00:00:48.632
Raymond:
How did you know our father?

00:00:48.632 --> 00:00:49.675
♪♪

00:00:49.675 --> 00:00:51.051
We were lovers for a while.

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:52.886
♪♪

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.012
What was he like as a father?

00:00:54.263 --> 00:00:55.264
The worst.

00:00:55.264 --> 00:00:56.014
(Arguing)

00:00:56.014 --> 00:00:58.058
Ray:
Like a weight on my chest.

00:00:58.058 --> 00:00:58.892
♪♪

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:00.060
Raymond:
Forgiveness is good.

00:01:00.686 --> 00:01:01.645
(Inhales)

00:01:01.645 --> 00:01:03.897
Hi, guys. This is my son, Simon.

00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:05.857
Lucia:
Raymond and Ray. 

00:01:07.109 --> 00:01:08.026
Your brothers.

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:10.320
Hello.

00:01:10.821 --> 00:01:11.822
Hi.

00:01:12.197 --> 00:01:14.241
♪♪

00:01:14.241 --> 00:01:15.492
Raymond:
We come from chaos.

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:16.952
♪♪

00:01:16.952 --> 00:01:19.955
Our father was a monster. We
repeat. We repeat.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.665
We don’t have to.

00:01:24.876 --> 00:01:26.962
(Plays trumpet)

00:01:26.962 --> 00:01:32.426
♪I'm going through changes♪

00:01:32.426 --> 00:01:35.429
Ray:
Growing up, my brother and I, we
were connected at the hip.

00:01:35.470 --> 00:01:37.139
♪♪

00:01:37.139 --> 00:01:42.477
And then just being near each
other is a reminder of all that
pain.

00:01:42.477 --> 00:01:45.480
♪Oh, in my life♪

00:01:45.689 --> 00:01:47.107
I want to know what it feels
like, 

00:01:47.649 --> 00:01:48.442
Raymond:
letting it go.

00:01:48.442 --> 00:01:50.402
♪♪

00:01:50.402 --> 00:01:52.029
Raymond:
But I'm scared it's gonna crush
me.

00:01:52.029 --> 00:01:53.030
♪♪

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:54.323
Raymond:
(Yelling)

00:01:54.323 --> 00:01:55.574
♪♪

00:01:55.574 --> 00:01:56.408
Raymond:
Come with me.

00:01:57.909 --> 00:01:58.744
Ray:
Okay.

00:01:59.995 --> 00:02:03.999
But, it's gonna take a whole lot
more than a hole in the ground
to get the old man out of your head.

00:02:04.374 --> 00:02:07.919
♪♪

